  _fragmentText: "ALDERMERE BUSINESS PARK \u2014 FACILITIES WORK ORDER #4471\n\nRequesting:
    Replacement fluorescent tubes, Sector 4, Stairwell C.\nStatus: Completed.\n\nNote:
    third request this month for the same fixtures. Maintenance insists they were
    replaced each time. No invoice on file for the parts. Suggest checking with Contracts
    before resubmitting."
